<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Shared Media Gallery</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }
        .gallery-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>📸 My Shared Media Gallery 🎥</h1>
    <p>Niche diye gaye button par click karke aap media dekh aur download kar sakte hain:</p>

    <div class="gallery-container">
        
        <!-- Aapki Google Photos Link Button -->
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Google Photos Media / Album</h3>
            <p>Photos aur videos ko bina kisi app ke dekhne aur download karne ke liye niche click karein:</p>
            <a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/FJ9mzoq8qsdBQG34A" target="_blank" class="btn">Open Photos & Download 📲</a>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
